	(text "USB-C INPUT (copied from Yuhka/ATWU MainboardV1, commit ccb1a9c, U20/USB1)\n- TPD4S201: OVP (short-to-VBUS up to 24V) + ESD on CC1/CC2 and SBU1/SBU2.\n- Trick from V1: D+/D- are routed through the SBU channels so they get OVP+ESD too.\n- RPD_Gx tied to C_CCx = dead-battery Rd while VPWR is unpowered; 5.1k Rd on system side.\n- FLT* is open-drain -> enable MCU pull-up (USB_FAULT = PB12)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.146 28.448 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62f55bb7-ec7b-46de-8e86-6e61ab198223")
	)
	(text "LANE_3V3: separate, slew-limited rail for the whole lane chain (600 uF).\nKeeps USB plug-in inrush tiny, lets the web app power-cycle all lanes (LANE_PWR_EN = PA6),\nand a lane short can't brown-out the controller / master clock."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.67 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "717e6469-8a46-45b5-a3cd-92c075269ff4")
	)
