		(property "Description" "Lane rail load switch, always-on reverse current blocking. CT cap C405 goes CT->VIN (DVDD_3V3), not GND. tR ~1.6 us/pF at 3.6 V: 10 nF -> ~16 ms ramp, ~0.12 A into ~610 uF of lane caps."
